<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="row align-items-center">

    <!-- Left Column: Text Content -->
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h2 class="text-primary mb-4">Temple Vision</h2>

      <h4 class="text-success">🛕 Temple Project</h4>
      <p>Discover our vision for a divine spiritual center inspired by TTD temple architecture and values.</p>

      <h4 class="text-info">🛤️ Road map to the Temple</h4>
      <p>Follow our journey—from concept to construction—toward building a sacred space for our community.</p>

      <h4 class="text-warning">🙏 TTD Murthys </h4>
      <p>Learn about the installation of revered deities in the temple following the traditions of Tirumala Tirupati Devasthanams.</p>

      <h4 class="text-primary">💫 TTD Srinivasa Kalyanams </h4>
      <p>Celebrate the celestial wedding of Lord Venkateswara with grandeur and devotion, annually organized in Hamburg.</p>

      <h4 class="text-danger">🕉️ Saturday Pooja</h4>
      <p>Sri Vari Darshanam in Hindu Mandir Hamburg; Visiting hours: 11am - 7pm CET.</p>
      <p>Join us every Saturday for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Vishnu Sahasranama Parayanam</li>
        <li>Govinda Namalu</li>
        <li>Hanuman Chalisa</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Image -->
    <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
      <%= image_tag("temple4.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow", alt: "TTD Temple Vision") %>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
